{"html_text": {"ja281:0.1": "<article id='ja281'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja281:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja281:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja281:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja281:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja281:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja281:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja281:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja281:4.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja281:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja281:0.2": "Tikanipāta ", "ja281:0.3": "Abbhantaravagga ", "ja281:0.4": "1. Abbhantarajātaka ", "ja281:1.1": "“Abbhantaro nāma dumo, ", "ja281:1.2": "yassa dibyamidaṁ phalaṁ; ", "ja281:1.3": "Bhutvā dohaḷinī nārī, ", "ja281:1.4": "cakkavattiṁ vijāyati. ", "ja281:2.1": "Tvampi bhadde mahesīsi, ", "ja281:2.2": "sā cāpi patino piyā; ", "ja281:2.3": "Āharissati te rājā, ", "ja281:2.4": "idaṁ abbhantaraṁ phalaṁ”. ", "ja281:3.1": "“Bhatturatthe parakkanto, ", "ja281:3.2": "yaṁ ṭhānamadhigacchati; ", "ja281:3.3": "Sūro attapariccāgī, ", "ja281:3.4": "labhamāno bhavāmahan”ti. ", "ja281:4.1": "Abbhantarajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja281:0.1": "", "ja281:0.2": "", "ja281:0.3": "", "ja281:0.4": "", "ja281:1.1": "Abbhantaro → abbhantaraṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja281:1.2": "", "ja281:1.3": "", "ja281:1.4": "", "ja281:2.1": "Tvampi → tañca (bj); tvañca (pts-vp-pli1); tvaṁ hi (mr) ", "ja281:2.2": "cāpi → cā si (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja281:2.3": "", "ja281:2.4": "", "ja281:3.1": "", "ja281:3.2": "", "ja281:3.3": ""